# Secrets and local environment files. Keep the documented template versioned.
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
**/.dev.vars*
!**/.dev.vars.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12

# Dependencies and generated outputs.
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/.vinext/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
**/.wrangler/
**/.sites-runtime/
**/out/
**/.cache/
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local tooling and OS files.
**/.DS_Store
**/.agents/
**/.codex/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*
